# Testing

## Expectations
- New or changed logic has unit tests.
- Every active feature test in `docs/test-cases/feature-tests/` passes before a
  version is shipped.
- TODO: coverage expectation, if any.

## Structure
- **Unit tests** live next to the source, per the stack's convention.
  `docs/test-cases/unit-tests/vX.Y.Z.T.md` maps them to WBS goals.
- **Feature tests** are specified in `docs/test-cases/feature-tests/` (Gherkin).
  Automated ones are implemented in the e2e/integration framework below, with
  the FT ID in the test name, e.g. `FT-v1.3.0.0-02 applies a valid coupon`.
- TODO: where integration/e2e test code lives.

